==German==

===Etymology===
''Kakao'' is in this case a euphemism for ''[[Kacke]]'' (Duden Herkunftswörterbuch 3rd ed.)

===Idiom===
'''[[durch]] [[den]] [[Kakao]] [[ziehen]]'''

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=de}} To rake somebody over the coals. To [[slate]] somebody or something.

